{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1790892721847,"sessionID":"ses_f067aa4e5ffevXywEi5R47GsUe","part":{"id":"prt_0f98646a00014vUv16vVlKWBSO","messageID":"msg_0f9862e5e001xXWxgWkc2As1bF","sessionID":"ses_f067aa4e5ffevXywEi5R47GsUe","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1790892767891,"sessionID":"ses_f067aa4e5ffevXywEi5R47GsUe","part":{"id":"prt_0f986c2810010PsjcR9XdIrtMS","messageID":"msg_0f9862e5e001xXWxgWkc2As1bF","sessionID":"ses_f067aa4e5ffevXywEi5R47GsUe","type":"text","text":"I now have all the operative control flow in `tenacity/__init__.py`. The synchronous path is: `Retrying.__call__` → `iter` → `_begin_iter` builds an ordered action list → `iter` executes each action in order, returning the last action's result; `__call__` returns that value directly unless it's a `DoAttempt`/`DoSleep`. Key branches:\n\n- `_post_retry_check_actions`: an accepted success (retry predicate false, no `TryAgain`) adds only `lambda rs: rs.outcome.result()` and returns — `after`, wait, and stop are never reached.\n- The retry path queues `_run_wait` **before** `_run_stop`, and `iter` runs actions in queue order.\n- `_post_stop_check_actions`: when stop fires, only `retry_error_callback` (or `exc_check`) is queued and it returns early; `before_sleep` is queued only in the continue-retrying fall-through.\n- Because `iter` returns the final action's result and `__call__` does `return do`, a `retry_error_callback`'s return value becomes the call's return value instead of raising `RetryError`.","time":{"start":1790892753537,"end":1790892767890}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790892767908,"sessionID":"ses_f067aa4e5ffevXywEi5R47GsUe","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"rehearsal_submit_answer","callID":"call_d0a79cb092d24b64892a2f79","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"answer":{"after_runs_on_accepted_success":{"citations":[{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"    def _post_retry_check_actions(self, retry_state: \"RetryCallState\") -> None:\n        if not (self.iter_state.is_explicit_retry or self.iter_state.retry_run_result):\n            self._add_action_func(lambda rs: rs.outcome.result())\n            return\n\n        if self.after is not None:\n            self._add_action_func(self.after)\n\n        self._add_action_func(self._run_wait)\n        self._add_action_func(self._run_stop)\n        self._add_action_func(self._post_stop_check_actions)"},{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"        self.iter_state.is_explicit_retry = fut.failed and isinstance(\n            fut.exception(), TryAgain\n        )\n        if not self.iter_state.is_explicit_retry:\n            self._add_action_func(self._run_retry)\n        self._add_action_func(self._post_retry_check_actions)"},{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"    def iter(self, retry_state: \"RetryCallState\") -> DoAttempt | DoSleep | t.Any:\n        self._begin_iter(retry_state)\n        result = None\n        for action in self.iter_state.actions:\n            result = action(retry_state)\n        return result"}],"value":false},"before_sleep_runs_when_stopped":{"citations":[{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"    def _post_stop_check_actions(self, retry_state: \"RetryCallState\") -> None:\n        if self.iter_state.stop_run_result:\n            if self.retry_error_callback:\n                self._add_action_func(self.retry_error_callback)\n                return\n\n            def exc_check(rs: \"RetryCallState\") -> None:\n                fut = t.cast(\"Future\", rs.outcome)\n                retry_exc = self.retry_error_cls(fut)\n                if self.reraise:\n                    retry_exc.reraise()\n                raise retry_exc from fut.exception()\n\n            self._add_action_func(exc_check)\n            return\n\n        def next_action(rs: \"RetryCallState\") -> None:\n            sleep = rs.upcoming_sleep\n            rs.next_action = RetryAction(sleep)\n            rs.idle_for += sleep\n            self.statistics[\"idle_for\"] += sleep\n            self.statistics[\"attempt_number\"] += 1\n\n        self._add_action_func(next_action)\n\n        if self.before_sleep is not None:\n            self._add_action_func(self.before_sleep)\n\n        self._add_action_func(lambda rs: DoSleep(rs.upcoming_sleep))"},{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"    def _run_stop(self, retry_state: \"RetryCallState\") -> None:\n        self.statistics[\"delay_since_first_attempt\"] = retry_state.seconds_since_start\n        self.iter_state.stop_run_result = self.stop(retry_state)"}],"value":false},"retry_error_callback_replaces_exhaustion_error":{"citations":[{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"        if self.iter_state.stop_run_result:\n            if self.retry_error_callback:\n                self._add_action_func(self.retry_error_callback)\n                return"},{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"        retry_error_callback: t.Callable[[\"RetryCallState\"], t.Any] | None = None,"},{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"            elif isinstance(do, DoSleep):\n                retry_state.prepare_for_next_attempt()\n                self.sleep(do)\n            else:\n                return do  # type: ignore[no-any-return]"},{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"        for action in self.iter_state.actions:\n            result = action(retry_state)\n        return result"}],"value":true},"wait_computed_before_stop":{"citations":[{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"        self._add_action_func(self._run_wait)\n        self._add_action_func(self._run_stop)\n        self._add_action_func(self._post_stop_check_actions)"},{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"        if not self.wait:  # type: ignore[truthy-bool]\n            retry_state.upcoming_sleep = 0.0\n        else:\n            retry_state.upcoming_sleep = self.wait(retry_state)"},{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"    def _run_stop(self, retry_state: \"RetryCallState\") -> None:\n        self.statistics[\"delay_since_first_attempt\"] = retry_state.seconds_since_start\n        self.iter_state.stop_run_result = self.stop(retry_state)"},{"path":"tenacity/__init__.py","quote":"        for action in self.iter_state.actions:\n            result = action(retry_state)\n        return result"}],"value":true}}},"output":"{\"submitted\":true}","metadata":{"truncated":false},"title":"","time":{"start":1790892767888,"end":1790892767898}},"id":"prt_0f986fa8b0010pUZrRrVV78Ncb","sessionID":"ses_f067aa4e5ffevXywEi5R47GsUe","messageID":"msg_0f9862e5e001xXWxgWkc2As1bF"}}
